  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Evaluation for the social accountability and support to Burma&#x2019;s participation in Extractive Industries Transparency Initiative projects is a component of Improving the management of public funds for the benefit of people in Myanmar reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;87,475. It works in the following sector(s): Public finance management (PFM), Business policy and administration, Public sector policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
